If gaming is important to
you or something like that,

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.130
or working out or whatever,
you have the freedom

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:33.100
to design your day in a way
that's most fulfilling to you.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.140
But once you do that,
be absolutely ruthless

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:39.840
with being engaged and intentional
with every single thing

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:40.760
on your schedule.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.720
That way when you're working,
you get way more work done

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.050
because you're concentrated,

