and you shouldn't actually be playing

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.160
and to develop focus specifically,

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:59.670
start off by scheduling
one hour of focus on

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:02.710
a very specific thing that
you really need to get done.

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:05.430
Pretty much everyone can manage one hour,

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:06.940
once they enter a flow state,

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.120
you know, try to break
past that 20 minute mark,

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.590
so you can enter that flow state.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.150
And after a couple of weeks
