00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.240
an hour of deep focus, ramp
it up to an hour and a half,

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.690
then to two hours, maybe
two and a half hours,

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.990
three, if it's, you know,
if you're really getting

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:24.010
the hang of it, I find that
three hours is sort of the point

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.010
