00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.330
and after that, it's sort
of diminishing returns.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.220
And as you get better at developing

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.730
the skill of concentration,
you'll find that

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.230
